      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿罗拉！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963F7F5762C9FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里是\n阿罗拉的样子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n普及委员会！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC662F000A963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A666E53CA59D454584F1AFF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……虽说是委员会，\n成员只有我一个人而已啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026867D8BF4662F59D454584F1AFF0C000A6210545853EA670962114E004E2A4EBA800C5DF255663002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，你知道地区形态吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然不管你知不知道，\n我都会继续说下去就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C4F6077E590535730533A5F6260015417FF1F00100001BE01000A867D71364E0D7BA14F6077E54E0D77E59053FF0C000A621190FD4F1A7EE77EED8BF44E0B53BB5C31662F4E863002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些宝可梦会受到\n地区的影响而改变样子哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B5B9D53EF68A64F1A53D75230000A5730533A76845F7154CD800C653953D868375B5054E6FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大家所熟知的雷丘也是如此，\n它在阿罗拉地区会进化为不同的样子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BB66240719F77E5768496F74E184E5F662F59826B64FF0C000A5B835728963F7F5762C95730533A4F1A8FDB53164E3A4E0D540C768468375B503002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与其解释到底哪里不同，\n还不如让雷丘互相比较一下比较好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E517689E391CA52305E9554EA91CC4E0D540CFF0C000A8FD84E0D59828BA996F74E184E9276F86BD48F834E004E0B6BD48F83597D3002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此我有个提议！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n让你的雷丘和我的\n阿罗拉的样子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来场宝可梦对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B64621167094E2A63D08BAEFF0100100001BE01000A8BA94F60768496F74E18548C62117684000A963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A6765573A5B9D53EF68A65BF962185427FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好让你的雷丘和\n我的阿罗拉的样子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来场宝可梦对战的话，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D8BA94F60768496F74E18548C000A62117684963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A6765573A5B9D53EF68A65BF9621876848BDDFF0C00100001BE00000A5C316765627E621154273002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让你的雷丘和我的\n阿罗拉的样子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来场宝可梦对战吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n让我们在同行队伍中各带1只！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA94F60768496F74E18548C62117684000A963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A6765573A5B9D53EF68A65BF962185427300200100001BE01000A8BA962114EEC5728540C884C961F4F0D4E2D54045E26003153EAFF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿罗拉的样子的雷丘！\n看起来很开心呀！不过，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n请你只带着1只雷丘来对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E18FF01000A770B8D7767655F885F005FC35440FF014E0D8FC7FF0C00100001BE00000A8BF74F6053EA5E267740003153EA96F74E1867655BF9621854273002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嚯，是雷丘啊！\n那么，要和我的阿罗拉的样子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来场宝可梦对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56AFFF0C662F96F74E18554AFF01000A90A34E48FF0C8981548C62117684963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A6765573A5B9D53EF68A65BF962185417FF1F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请让我开展阿罗拉的样子的雷丘\n普及委员会的活动吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF78BA962115F005C55963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E18000A666E53CA59D454584F1A76846D3B52A85427FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "两只雷丘都很棒，\n但阿罗拉的样子属性不同，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以不要困惑哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2453EA96F74E1890FD5F8868D2FF0C000A4F46963F7F5762C9768468375B505C5E60274E0D540CFF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE54E0D898156F060D154E6FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好精彩的胜利……！\n但阿罗拉的样子的雷丘<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n普及委员会的活动接下来才正式开始。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7CBE5F69768480DC522920262026FF01000A4F46963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E1800100001BE00000A666E53CA59D454584F1A76846D3B52A863A54E0B6765624D6B635F0F5F0059CB3002001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用我的阿罗拉的样子的雷丘\n和你的雷丘交换吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "752862117684963F7F5762C9768468375B50768496F74E18000A548C4F60768496F74E184EA463625427FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "交换",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EA463620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太可惜了！但为了普及委员会的活动，\n我会一直在这里等你哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A53EF60DC4E86FF014F464E3A4E86666E53CA59D454584F1A76846D3B52A8FF0C000A62114F1A4E0076F457288FD991CC7B494F6054E6FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雷丘和雷丘来交换，\n阿罗拉的样子永流传～♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96F74E18548C96F74E1867654EA46362FF0C000A963F7F5762C9768468375B506C386D414F20FF5E266A001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我懂你！毕竟交换宝可梦\n会让人感到依依不舍嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621161C24F60FF016BD57ADF4EA463625B9D53EF68A6000A4F1A8BA94EBA611F52304F9D4F9D4E0D820D561BFF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿罗拉的样子固然很好，\n但普通的雷丘也很迷人哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963F7F5762C9768468375B5056FA71365F88597DFF0C000A4F46666E901A768496F74E184E5F5F888FF74EBA54E6FF01001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雷雷雷～咿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96F796F796F7FF5E54BFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，我要再次踏上旅途了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我会前往阿罗拉，和许许多多\n阿罗拉的样子的雷丘成为朋友，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n并在全世界发扬光大……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这就是普及委员会的活动！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
